BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Qi Gong (Mindful Movement) at Barbieri Park in Healdsburg
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T110000
UID:261009_QqC1vXqQkaEFaGUZOMC8g
DESCRIPTION:Marianne Benforado\, Licensed Acupuncturist and Certified Qi G
 ong Teacher will offer a mindful movement class at Barbieri Park in Healds
 burg on Saturday\, October 10 and Saturday\, October 24\, from 10–11 am.
  $20 drop in. Come to either or both!\n\nThere’s something really specia
 l about practicing Qi Gong outside. It's a good reminder that we’re part
  of Nature. We move with the trees\, feel our feet on the grass\, breathe 
 the fresh air\, listen to the birdies and take in the long view toward the
  hills and vineyards. All senses engaged!\n\nIt’s a beautiful way to get
  out of our heads for awhile. No experience is needed. Really! Just show u
 p and mirror the movements. Come a few minutes early to pay and get regist
 ered.
LOCATION:Barbieri Park
URL:https://feelbetteracu.com/events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MEET THE ARTIST RECEPTION painter Aaron Webb THE ALCHEMY OF DISTAN
 T TIDES
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T160000
UID:26100970cOSXUHDk2nlLeYSZ0cWg
DESCRIPTION:MEET THE ARTIST RECEPTION Saturday\, October 10th\, 2026 Noon
   - 4pm\n\nTHE ALCHEMY OF DISTANT TIDES Abstract Paintings by Aaron Webb\
 n\nIn The Alchemy of Distant Tides\, abstract painter and Navy sailor Aaro
 n Webb continues to explore the places we leave\, the places we seek\, and
 \, most compellingly\, the ways memory transforms both. Through saltwater\
 , oxidation\, layered surfaces\, and elemental materials\, these paintings
  trace the passage between experience and remembrance\; where distance bec
 omes longing\, time becomes patina\, and the sea becomes both memory and m
 etaphor.\n\nExplore a new body of work shaped by the wild sea and the tran
 sformative forces of time and tide.
LOCATION:Rena Charles Gallery
URL:http://www.renacharlesgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
