DESCRIPTION:Sincere Cider and Johnny Doughnuts are teaming up on Apple Cid
 er Donut\, a limited-release cider inspired by the classic fall treat. Mad
 e with apple juice\, cinnamon\, and sugar\, the cider is naturally gluten-
 free\, vegan\, and 5.9% ABV. The tasting tour kicks off at Napa Yard.\n\nB
 e one of the first to sip the collaboration from two of the Bay Area's mos
 t beloved local brands. Napa is the first stop on a tour that wraps up at 
 the Spark Social Cider Fest in San Francisco on November 7. The cider is o
 nly available for a limited time and while supplies last.
