DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T213000
UID:2609188DAfmrWobk-FgKis-4TBeQ
DESCRIPTION:Experience the soulful sounds and rich traditions of Hawai‘i
  with three legendary masters of slack key guitar—George Kahumoku Jr.\,
  Led Kaapana\, and Jeff Peterson.\n\nRooted in the 19th-century paniolo \\
 (Hawaiian cowboy\\) culture\, slack key is a uniquely Hawaiian open-tuning
  guitar style passed down through generations. These three acclaimed music
 ians bring together decades of tradition\, storytelling\, and virtuosic mu
 sicianship.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Cultural Center
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/masters-of-hawaiian-mus
 ic-george-kahumoku-jr-led-kaapana-jeff-peterson/19944096/2026-10-10T19
