BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:John Prine Tribute with David Luning\, Jason Crosby\, Ben Dubin an
 d Victoria George
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T200000
UID:260923TKb33RQi2E-rS0yFlHEz5A
DESCRIPTION:David Luning returns to OCA for a special tribute celebrating 
 John Prine's birthday. David will be joined by musical colleagues Jason Cr
 osby\, Ben Dubin and Victoria George. Tickets are $35\, $30 for OCA member
 s.  Get Tickets This show will take place in our auditorium. Doors open at
  5:30 PM. David Luning knew at a young age the path his life should take. 
 Throughout generations\, troubadours and singers have harnessed the cultur
 al landscape and passed it along\, with the likes of John Prine and Townes
  Van Zandt paving the way with the telling of their stories. Following in 
 those footsteps\, the 29-year-old Sonoma County singer/songwriter's new re
 cord is the product of a massive turn in his life and taps into that cultu
 ral archive. Listening to ‘Souvenirs' by John Prine\, was a cornerstone 
 moment\, compelling Luning to leave Berklee College and follow in the trad
 ition of these iconic troubadours.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/david-lunin
 g-friends
