DESCRIPTION:Experience the vibrant sounds of the new SSU Community Concert
  Band\, led by conductor Dr. Andy Collinsworth\, alongside the electrifyin
 g Blue Devils Winds under Dr. Kaitlin Bove. This dynamic program features 
 Rossano Galante’s soaring overture Colorado Rockies\, Thom Ritter George
 ’s classic band work *First Suite in F*\, SSU trumpet professor Dan Norr
 is performing Alexander Goedecke’s dazzling *Concert Etude\, op. 49*\, O
 mar Thomas’ jazz infused Forward/Still\, Ira Hearshen’s arrangement of
  *Symphonic Dances from Fiddler on the Roof*\, and John Philip Sousa’s s
 oaring march *The Invincible Eagle*. Join us for an unforgettable evening 
 of musical brilliance at the heart of campus life!
LOCATION:Sonoma State University - Joan and Sanford I. Weill Hall
