DESCRIPTION:Join us for this sewing basics program! First\, we will learn 
 how to thread a bobbin and a needle on a sewing machine. Then we will make
  a canvas bag. Sewing machines and all materials will be provided. Joseph 
 Domingo is a Fashion Designer\, Show producer/director and a pageant mento
 r. In 1999\, he established his namesake atelier on Post Street in San Fra
 ncisco that served as both design studio and showroom for over two decades
 . Domingo relocated his operation to Healdsburg during the pandemic. His c
 ollection has been showcased in major magazines and fashion weeks in the n
 ation and abroad. Joseph's fashions have been worn by Miss USA\, Miss Amer
 ica\, Miss Universe\, television and film celebrities along with music ent
 ertainers like Taylor Dane and Shakira. His new endeavor is the Fashion Me
 ntorship & Scholarship Program \\(FMSPGlobal.com\\).
