UID:261007Y1fMWk1HtkWGbpp00MCo0Q
DESCRIPTION:If you have been waiting for the perfect moment to ride our Ap
 ple Trolley\, this is it. Savor the beauty of the changing seasons on a sc
 enic farm tour that takes you beyond the ride.\n\nDuring this special expe
 rience\, you will learn more about our 88-acre farm and how we grow our or
 ganic olives\, apples\, and citrus. You will also have a chance to stroll 
 through the orchard and meet Mark Marthaler\, who will explain his inspira
 tion for the Apple Trolley. He will show you where he produces his other a
 rt—including the giant apples and vibrant butterflies dotted across our 
 farm – and share his design secrets and inspiration that turned a simple
  orchard ride into a living piece of art.\n\nYour ticket Includes:\n\nA gu
 ided journey through the orchard on our Apple Trolley.\n\nAn exclusive art
 ist meet-and-greet with artist Mark Marthaler.\n\nStraus vanilla ice cream
  topped with Gold Ridge Organic Farms Apple Cider Syrup or Meyer Lemon Cit
 rus Oil.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://goldridgeorganicfarms.ticketspice.com/ultimate-apple-trolley-e
 xperience
