UID:261005rEZPouR7DEqFEn2YTHDaaw
DESCRIPTION:CALLING ALL FIRST RESPONDERS & CAR ENTHUSIASTS!    \n\nJoi
 n First Responders Resiliency\, Inc.® for the 2026 First Responders Ca
 r Show — a day of incredible cars\, community\, connection\, and suppor
 t for those who serve.\n\n Saturday\, October 17\, 2026  10:00 AM – 3:
 00 PM\n\n First Responder Resiliency Center 1475 W. Sierra Ave.\, Cotati\
 , CA 94931\n\n General Admission: FREE  Vehicle Registration: $35\n\n B
 RING YOUR CAR\n\nHave a vehicle you’re proud of? We want to see it! Regi
 ster your vehicle for $35\, which includes your vehicle entry and two ad
 missions\, including the driver.\n\n COME ENJOY THE SHOW\n\nGeneral admis
 sion is FREE! Bring your family\, check out the cars\, connect with fell
 ow first responders and community members\, and spend the day supporting a
  great cause.\n\n SUPPORT FIRST RESPONDERS\n\nProceeds benefit First Res
