DESCRIPTION:Hi\, I’m Olive. I’m from Portland\, Oregon\, and I write s
 ongs about my feelings\, being queer\, having a strange brain\, and coming
  of age in a confusing world. My goal in sharing this music is to make oth
 ers feel a little more connected to each other and to their deeper selves
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1039812621?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
