DESCRIPTION:In this intimate three-hour workshop\, you’ll slow down\, re
 connect with yourself\, and experience The Letting Go Art Experience as a 
 guided creative journey.\n\nThrough gentle meditation or breathwork\, mean
 ingful conversation\, expressive art exercises\, and reflective prompts\, 
 you’ll move beyond creating artwork and begin exploring what your creati
 vity has to teach you.\n\nThis isn’t about learning artistic techniques.
 \n\nIt’s about discovering what happens when you stop trying to make som
 ething perfect and start listening to your own intuition instead.\n\nEvery
  Deep Dive follows a thoughtfully designed beginning\, middle\, and end\, 
 creating space for insight\, self-expression\, laughter\, and meaningful c
 onnection.\n\nLeave feeling lighter\, more inspired\, and more connected
 —to yourself and to others.\n\n$45 • Ages 18\\+ Limited to 15 particip
 ants
