BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sweeney Todd
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T140000
UID:260909BUMcPJ2aXUGvqGNh-Q51LQ
DESCRIPTION:Sweeney Todd is largely considered one of Stephen Sondheim’s
  masterpieces. With it\, he aimed to create a musical that could “scare 
 the hell out of everyone\,” and yet\, somehow\, be funny.\n\nThe story c
 enters around Sweeney Todd\, an unjustly exiled barber who returns to Lond
 on\, seeking vengeance against the lecherous judge who framed him and rava
 ged his young wife. The road to revenge leads Todd to Mrs. Lovett\, a reso
 urceful proprietress of a failing pie shop\, above which\, he opens a new 
 barber practice. Mrs. Lovett’s luck sharply shifts when Todd’s thirst 
 for blood inspires the integration of an ingredient into her meat pies tha
 t has the people of 19th Century London lining up…and the carnage has on
 ly just begun!\n\n\\***Content Advisory:** Adult language and violent the
 mes\, as well as controversial pie recipes. Recommended for 12+.\n\nRunnin
 g Time: 2 hours\, 40 minutes including one intermission.\n\nOctober 23rd\,
  24th\, 25th\, \\*29th\, 30th\, 31st\, Nov 1st\, 6th\, 7th\, 8th.\n\nBook 
 by Hugh Wheeler\n\nMusic and Lyrics by Stephen Sondheim\n\nDirected by Ste
 ven David Martin\n\n**Friday and Saturday Shows:** 7:30 PM\n\n**Sunday Mat
 inee:** 2:00 PM\n\n**\\*Value Thursday:** 7:30 PM\n\n**Admission:** \n\nA
 dults: $44\n\nStudent w/ID: $10\n\n\\*Special Value Thursday Performanc
 e: Pay What You Can
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/sweeney-todd/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marin Farmers Markets
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T130000
UID:260903i4UJB6RV-ECXn4FMWQk8bw
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free Sponsor: Marin Center\n\nExplore the bounty of sum
 mer at the Marin Farmers Markets. Taste vine-ripened tomatoes\, corn that 
 was picked that morning\, and peaches so juicy you have to bend over just 
 to get a bite. Farm-fresh eggs\, grass-fed beef\, artisan c heeses\, raw m
 ilk\, and freshly baked breads complete the shopping exper ience. Specialt
 y prepared foods and handmade art add to the magic of the market. Enjoy th
 e intimate feeling of the Thursday Marin Farmers Market\, an ideal place t
 o meet for lunch and pick up fresh produce for the weekend. Discover the a
 bundance and diversity of product at the celebrated Sunday Marin Farmers M
 arket\, the third largest farmers market in California. Turn your dollar i
 nto a vote for local sustainable agriculture\, shrink your eco-footprint\,
  and revive the feeling of being intimate ly connected to your food by mee
 ting your farmers face-to-face. The market takes place rain or shine.  www
 .aginstitutemarin.org
LOCATION:Marin County Civic Center
URL:https://www.marincounty.org/main/calendar#/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T170000
UID:260824GzGbyJ8hsU2lqIiT6p1vJg
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T103000
UID:260728NPWkKM3mmECmdI79-C33qA
DESCRIPTION:Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.\n\nIn OA\, membe
 rs experience spiritual\, emotional\, and physical recovery by practicing 
 the Twelve Steps and living by their spiritual principles—one day at a t
 ime.\n\nOvereaters Anonymous \\(OA\\) is a fellowship of people who suppor
 t each other in recovering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If y
 ou feel you have a problem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what yo
 ur background\, beliefs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person meet
 ings at 9:30 on Sunday mornings at Church of the Nazarene\, 18980 Arnold D
 rive\, Sonoma\, CA \\(a small room directly off of parking lot\; look for 
 the sign posted\\) and newcomers are always welcome.\n\nYou may view all N
 orth Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/me
 etings.html\n\nOA is not a diet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembe
 rs have different plans of eating.\n\nOA does not endorse any specific foo
 d plan. \n\nVisit: https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\nFind a meeting: https:/
 /www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
