DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T000000
UID:260504W_qzQ-lm9kejD57T3inNmg
DESCRIPTION:A fun community bike ride through the heart of Santa Rosa. Com
 e join us this Tuesday! We roll through the JC and McDonald Ave neighborho
 od\, stop in Courthouse Square\, then on to the taco trucks at Mitote Food
  Park in Roseland for dinner! We depart Mitote at 8:15pm\, ride back throu
 gh Courthouse Square\, then on to Yogurt Farms for dessert. This ride is 8
  miles round trip and rides all year long. Rides canceled for rain and hol
 idays. All riders welcome. Bring the whole family! Meet at SRJC parking lo
 t at 550 Silva Ave. We are renting the use of this parking lot every Tuesd
 ay from 5:30pm to 9:30 pm. Taco Tuesday riders can park in the lot during 
 that time frame for free. Please park cars along the back wall on the east
  side. And stage in the row on the northern side of the lot \\(closest to 
 Silva Ave\\). Meet at 5:30pm\; pedals up at 6pm.
LOCATION:SRJC Parking Lot
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Freestyle Playground Dance Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T193000
UID:261008xTB11_rvnkS7XNHUOIhMgQ
DESCRIPTION:Freestyle Playground — 4-Week Dance & Movement Series\n\nExp
 lore. Play. Create. Express.\n\nReady to discover new ways of moving and e
 xpressing yourself through dance?\n\nFreestyle Playground is a playful\, c
 reative dance class designed to expand your movement vocabulary\, spark yo
 ur imagination\, and help you discover your own unique movement style.\n\n
 Through guided freestyle exercises\, imaginative movement concepts\, music
 ality\, elements of popping\, rhythm\, and body awareness\, you'll explore
  new ways to move\, experiment\, and create.\n\nEach week\, we'll introduc
 e different movement tools and concepts that you can combine\, build upon\
 , and incorporate into your own dancing.\n\nThis isn't a choreography-base
 d class. It's about exploration\, curiosity\, and the freedom to move with
 out worrying about getting it "right."\n\nWhether you're an experienced da
 ncer looking for fresh inspiration or someone curious about exploring move
 ment\, all levels are welcome!\n\nClass Details\n\n📍 Laguna Lab | Sebas
 topol\, CA\n\n📅 4 Tuesdays: October 27\, November 3\, 10 & 17\n\n⏰ 6:
 30–7:30 PM\n\n💃 All levels welcome!\n\nCome expand your creativity\, 
 discover new movement possibilities\, and experience the joy of freestyle 
 dance!\n\nNo perfection. Just movement\, music\, imagination & PLAY!
LOCATION:Laguna Lab
URL:https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lagunalab/2417443
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
