BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T170000
UID:26082489YmqDYLCUiaiusXybT_Ag
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Music Happy Hour - The Ukulele Ramblers - Open Uke Jam!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T190000
UID:260719oeMSF1ds-EWHrw5E1yx85w
DESCRIPTION:Downtown Santa Rosa 'Golden Hour' 4-7p| Live music 5-7 p | $6 
 beers & $2 off wine |Tuesday-Saturday!\n\nFor people who like to party...b
 ut want to be home at a reasonable hour...Welcome to **Live Music - The Uk
 ulele Ramblers - Open Uke Jam!** Join us for a fun-filled evening of live 
 music and ukulele jamming at Barrel Proof Lounge. Bring your ukulele and s
 trum along with The Ukulele Ramblers\, a talented group of musicians who w
 ill be performing a mix of classic tunes and original songs. Whether you'r
 e a seasoned ukulele player or a beginner looking to learn\, this event is
  perfect for all music lovers. So mark your calendars and get ready to enj
 oy a night of great music and good vibes. See you there!\n\nOpen Uke jam h
 osted by your friendly neighborhood Ukulele collective.\n\nBring your sing
 ing voice and your Uke if you've got one\, and enjoy the comfortable\, wel
 coming space at Barrel Proof Lounge! 21+ Happy Hour Pricing 4-6pm All beer
 s - $6 + $2 off wine. Live Music 5-7pm 2 drink minimum\, please\n\n**www.U
 kuleleRamblers.net** Check out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts
  of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/live-music-happy-hour-the-ukulele-rambler
 s-open-uke-jam-tickets-1980136780414?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Big Stage Karaoke Wednesdays with KJ Danny D
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261029T013000
UID:2607185e4QZiY1C0OCOW0ncf850w
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday nights at Barrel Proof Lounge just got louder\, sexi
 er\, and way more fun.\n\nKaraoke moves to the main showroom big stage eve
 ry Wednesday at 9pm\, following Open Mic\, and runs until late. Hosting th
 e night is KJ Danny D (Danny Duclos)—one of the most popular and in-dema
 nd karaoke hosts around. We’re genuinely stoked to have him bringing his
  style\, energy\, and crowd-moving presence to Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nThi
 s isn’t sleepy bar karaoke. Danny brings a fresh\, high-energy approach 
 that turns singing into a full-on late-night experience. Big stage\, great
  sound\, packed room\, and the kind of momentum that keeps people singing 
 well past closing time.\n\nMain showroom  Starts 9pm (after Open Mic)  N
 o cover  Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nCheck out **www.barrelprooflounge.com**
  for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/big-stage-karaoke-wednesdays-with-kj-dann
 y-d-tickets-1981510993723?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
