 \n\nDoors 6:00 PM | Show 7:00 PM | 21+\n\nSlip on your sexiest spookiest e
 nsemble and join us for an unforgettable night with Northern California’
 s #1 psychic medium\, Jenessa \, right here at Barrel Proof Lounge in Down
 town Santa Rosa.\n\nJenessa has captivated audiences across the Bay with h
 er uncanny ability to deliver heartfelt messages from beyond—while keepi
 ng everyone laughing with her sharp wit and playful energy. Expect tears o
 f joy\, goosebumps\, and plenty of laughs as she connects with the audienc
 e in this one-of-a-kind live show.\n\n Tickets: - General Admission: $35 
 advance | $49 at the door - VIP Table for 4: $189 — includes a bottle of
  wine\, bubbly\, or a round of drinks + your own server call button\n\nSea
 ting is limited and this show will sell out fast —don’t wait to snag y
 our spot!\n\nJenessa will be performing for 90+ minutes and randomly readi
 ng members of the audience (with permission). While many people will get a
  reading\, we cannot guarantee everyone will.\n\nStick around for a sexy c
 ostume dance party with DJ Decks at 10!  Beer\, wine\, Soju cocktails\, a
 nd free popcorn all night long.  Barrel Proof Lounge\, 501 Mendocino Ave\
 , downtown Santa Rosa  21+ only\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com*
 * for all sorts of good times ahead!
