DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T210000
UID:260830XaZkVkpFZUGtLX1fQOjByg
DESCRIPTION:The LIME Foundation proudly presents So You Think Sonoma Count
 y’s Got Talent with the Stars\, a high-energy celebration of the voices\
 , movement and creativity that make our community unique. From music and d
 ance to unexpected moments on stage\, this exciting evening puts local tal
 ent front and center.\n\nThe event highlights the Turner Arts Initiative\,
  which gives youth the space and support to explore music\, dance and crea
 tive expression. It is about more than performing—it is about confidence
 \, self-expression and discovering what becomes possible when creativity i
 s nurtured.\n\nEvery act represents dedication\, courage and the bold spir
 it of Sonoma County’s next generation of artists. Join us for an energet
 ic and memorable evening filled with moments you will not want to miss.\n\
 nReady to take the stage? Apply at https://form.jotform.com/2621071530640
 44. Auditions begin September 21.
LOCATION:Sally Tomatoes
URL:http://www.limetalent.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
