DESCRIPTION:About the Event Paint Your Pet - Nov 3rd\, 2026 Celebrate your
  furry friend by joining us for a unique art event where you'll create a p
 ersonalized portrait of your pet! Here's how it works: Registration Instru
 ctions:In your registration email\, please use the subject line "Paint You
 r Pet 11/3/26" and include your name \\(or the name of the person painting
